    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A real tower defense game set in a medieval fantasy world. Place different units like archers and wizards in smart ways to stop enemy armies from attacking your village!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Strategy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need two kinds of strategy: where to place your units on the map, and when to upgrade them with your limited money. These two strategy parts work together to make deep and fun gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Difficulty by Daruma The Factory</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game has high difficulty that focuses on strategy. It is not easy, but that makes it very satisfying when you win. Your strategy skills will be tested. Enjoy this challenging game experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple and Easy Controls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No difficult controls needed. Simple rules that anyone can start playing right away. But you need deep strategy to clear the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Medieval Fantasy World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight with brave warriors in a beautiful pixel art medieval fantasy world to protect your village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Good For These Players</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- People who like strategy games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- People who want challenging high-difficulty games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- People who love tower defense games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- People who want to feel great achievement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you become the true King of Tower Defense?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your challenge now and show your strategy skills!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A real tower defense game set in a medieval fantasy world. Place different units like archers and wizards in smart ways to stop enemy armies from attacking your village!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Strategy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need two kinds of strategy: where to place your units on the map, and when to upgrade them with your limited money. These two strategy parts work together to make deep and fun gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Difficulty by Daruma The Factory</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game has high difficulty that focuses on strategy. It is not easy, but that makes it very satisfying when you win. Your strategy skills will be tested. Enjoy this challenging game experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple and Easy Controls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No difficult controls needed. Simple rules that anyone can start playing right away. But you need deep strategy to clear the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Medieval Fantasy World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight with brave warriors in a beautiful pixel art medieval fantasy world to protect your village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Good For These Players</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- People who like strategy games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- People who want challenging high-difficulty games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- People who love tower defense games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- People who want to feel great achievement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you become the true King of Tower Defense?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your challenge now and show your strategy skills!</p>",
